# Used as the build context for seshat-server's image (needs seshat/ +
# seshat-server/ only, per its go.mod "replace ... => ../seshat"). Everything
# else in this monorepo is irrelevant to that build and would only slow down
# the context transfer.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
website
seshat-ui
seshat-backend
seshat-console
helps
private
project
scripts
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
**/.seshat
